      "mergeID": "6224132517b26374d726d296",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Ignore Transforms will not work on any avatar with Physbones or Dynamic Bones if the Root Transform is set to a Humanoid part of the armature (such as Head/Neck/Chest/Hips/etc).\nNot sure why that is, but it's breaking a lot of avatars set up this way due to the Physbones applying to too much of the avatar at once.\nAgain, \"Ignore Transforms\" just doesn't work in these cases.",
