  "details": "PhysBones seems to lock the Head joint from rotation as well as some other bones. If I disable Dynamic Bone Conversion the avatar will work as normal. Avatars without Dynamic/PhysBone are normal. I suspect the Angle Limit is being applied at 0 to all bones on the model, or at least the head. Most likely do to the way the head bone is treated in mirrors? Thoughts?",
